      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Without using a sync parameter, the sync for contacts are based off the individual client which can lead to some de-syncs in situations. For example if you go to boop me but on my screen your finger is about to touch my boop contact on 1 frame and the next is passed my boop contact then I wont see the animation however you will. You can always attempt to fix this by either making the contact bigger to compensate or use a sync parameter.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
