      "value": "@{61159f1bd6c0026f470c4521|full_name}: First just gonna point out the info prompt on contact receivers that does mention about the use of synced params and second, you're quite right, local handles the contact for you only but when using a synced param instead of a contact param (so a param from your expression parameter list), you will sync it like when you toggle something from the action menu",
