  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have created an avatar using the dynamics system with a series of many contact receivers that each trigger an animation on enter with an index finger.\nIssue is, I’ll be in the avatar and other users will interact with these receivers and often THEY see the animation, but I do not. As if it is not synchronized between players. It’s ruining the function of my avatar with the new dynamics system.",
